#: org.kde.kblackbox.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KBlackbox is a game of hide and seek played on a grid of boxes where the computer has hidden several balls. The position of the hidden balls can be deduced by shooting beams into the box."
msgstr "KBlackbox je igra skrivača na mreži polja u kojoj je računalo sakrilo nekoliko kuglica. Položaj skrivenih kuglica može se odrediti ispaljivanjem laserskih zraka u kutiju."
